- Tests: \`pnpm run test\`
- Lint: \`pnpm run lint\`
- Typecheck: \`pnpm run typecheck\`
- Full gate: \`pnpm run lint && pnpm run typecheck && pnpm run test\`

## Invariants
Invariants version 1.3.0 · ratified 2026-08-31 · last amended 2026-10-14

